   "gap": "The proof of thm:p15-os-exponential-exit shows that a nonconstant increment with E exp(theta0 xi1)=1, theta0<0, takes strictly positive and strictly negative values with positive probability by writing only the case xi1>=0 a.s.; the case xi1<=0 a.s. is dismissed as 'analogous' (annex line 595). Owed written step: if xi1<=0 a.s. then theta0*xi1>=0, so exp(theta0 xi1)>=1 with mean one, forcing exp(theta0 xi1)=1 and xi1=0 a.s., contradicting nonconstancy.",
